{"hash": "99d04729b969fb39", "text": "The same clerk works in many rooms and buildings. A mode is the kind of job. A platform is where it runs, and what it can touch. Claude's modes were chat, Cowork and Code. Cowork, launched in January, is an agent for office work on your files. In mid-September, Anthropic began merging chat and Cowork into one Claude that decides whether to answer you or do the work. It's rolling out to Pro and Max first. Claude Code stays its own room. The buildings: the browser, the desktop app, your phone, the terminal C L I, editor extensions, and cloud sessions that run on Anthropic's machines. Local sees your files, and stops when your laptop sleeps. Cloud sees only what you give it, and keeps going with the lid shut. OpenAI pulled Chat, Work and Codex into one desktop app in July. Google folded Gemini C L I into Antigravity in June. Coding agents live in The Machine.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "m", "e", " ", "c", "l", "e", "r", "k", " ", "w", "o", "r", "k", "s", " ", "i", "n", " ", "m", "a", "n", "y", " ", "r", "o", "o", "m", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "b", "u", "i", "l", "d", "i", "n", "g", "s", ".", " ", "A", " ", "m", "o", "d", "e", " ", "i", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "k", "i", "n", "d", " ", "o", "f", " ", "j", "o", "b", ".", " ", "A", " ", "p", "l", "a", "t", "f", "o", "r", "m", " ", "i", "s", " ", "w", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "i", "t", " ", "r", "u", "n", "s", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "w", "h", "a", "t", " ", "i", "t", " ", "c", "a", "n", " ", "t", "o", "u", "c", "h", ".", " ", "C", "l", "a", "u", "d", "e", "'", "s", " ", "m", "o", "d", "e", "s", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "c", "h", "a", "t", ",", " ", "C", "o", "w", "o", "r", "k", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "C", "o", "d", "e", ".", " ", "C", "o", "w", "o", "r", "k", ",", " ", "l", "a", "u", "n", "c", "h", "e", "d", " ", "i", "n", " ", "J", "a", "n", "u", "a", "r", "y", ",", " ", "i", "s", " ", "a", "n", " ", "a", "g", "e", "n", "t", " 